IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Il torneo di pesca sta per iniziare!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Catturerò pesci in gran quantità e li
trasformerò in una cena deliziosa!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non poteva esserci giornata
migliore per il torneo di pesca.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ci saranno pesci a profusione!

{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Il torneo di pesca è iniziato!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sarà una lunga lotta fra me{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
e i pesciolini quest'oggi.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Das {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Angelturnier {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}hat begonnen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Die Fische gegen mich...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Mal sehen,
wer am Ende gewinnt!

FR:
Je vise le premier prix aujourd'hui.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}La clé du succès, c'est la patience...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Rester calme même quand ça mord.
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Sans être trop prudent pour autant,
ou la proie file avec l'hameçon !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Il
faut trouver le juste milieu...

IT:
Per una vittoria sicura{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}è fondamentale mantenere la calma
e attendere che il pesce abbocchi.
Tuttavia, {{TAG:0003:0028:}}se agisci con eccessiva
cautela,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} il pesce fuggirà con l'esca.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Devi trovare il giusto equilibrio.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Je ne me suis pas assez entraînée...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ce n'est vraiment pas évident de
tirer la ligne au bon moment !

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Cómo se te está dando el Torneo
de Pesca? ¿Pican mucho?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Te deseo mucha suerte!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Quali sono i tuoi pronostici per
il torneo di oggi?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Pensi di vincere?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Anch'io punto alla vittoria, sai?

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non è meraviglioooso pescare
in una giornata bella come questa?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Mi sento benissimissimo!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tengo pensada la estrategia ideal.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Pero no sé si podré usarla antes
de que se acabe el torneo!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Did you catch a lot of fish today?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Not to brag,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} but I have a feeling I'll
be eating fish sandwiches all week.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Han picado mucho hoy?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}No me gusta presumir, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¡pero yo
comeré pescado toda la semana!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Alors, com'è andata la tua pesca?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Non per vantarmi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ma per quanto mi
riguarda potrei aprire una pescheria!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bugün çok balık tuttun mu?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Övünmek gibi olmasın,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ama sanırım bütün
hafta balıklı sandviç yiyeceğim.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aunque no está bien tener apego
a los bienes materiales{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} la verdad
es que me gustaría ganar un trofeo.{{TAG:0003:0004:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}J'espère que je vais gagner un prix !
{{TAG:0007:0001:}}J'ai une passion pour les coupes et
les trophées !{{TAG:0003:0004:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non mi dispiacerebbe essere
fra i vincitori.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Io adoooro
lo scintillio dei trofei!{{TAG:0003:0004:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Congratulations on your award!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Maybe we should celebrate with a
big fish dinner,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Enhorabuena por tu premio!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Esto hay que celebrarlo comiendo
un pescado bien grande!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ich gratuliere dir zum Preis!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Gibt es jetzt zur Feier ein leckeres
Fischbrötchen, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ödülün için tebrikler!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Bunu büyük bir balık yemeğiyle kutlasak
mı,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Nicht zu fassen, dass ich so gut war!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ist doch toll, dass wir beide unter
den ersten drei waren, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu kadar iyi yaptığıma inanamıyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
İkimizin de ilk üçe girmesine sevindim,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Çok heyecanlıyım!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ödülüm kitaplığımda,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
balıkçılık kitaplarımın yanında
harika duracak.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Non ti avvilire, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Sono sicura che al prossimo
torneo non avrai rivali!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Dommage que tu ne sois pas ven{{TAG:000E:0006:02007500040075006500}}
à la remise des prix,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}C'était une cérémonie inoubliable,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Castor{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} était en très grande forme !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}È un vero peccato che ti sia pers{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
la cerimonia, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Castore{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
è stato un conduttore très original!

{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ti sei pers{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} una delle cerimonie più
toccanti della storia, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Vieni con me la prossima volta!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Çok duygulu bir ödül törenini kaçırdın.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bir dahaki sefere gideceğine söz
ver,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I'm really looking forward to the
next {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Especially if you'll visit us again!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Già attendo con trepidazione
il prossimo torneo di pesca.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}, ci devi essere anche tu!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bir sonraki {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Balık Turnuvası{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}nı şimdiden
bekliyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Özellikle de bizi yine ziyaret edeceksen!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Sono davvero dispiaciuta per
l'annullamento della cerimonia.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Et bien, sarà per la prossima volta!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ich bin ein wenig enttäuscht, dass
die Preisverleihung abgesagt wurde.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich wollte doch allen gratulieren!

{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Es gibt diesmal also keine
Preisverleihung. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Schaaade.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Na ja, hoffentlich nächstes Mal!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Demek ödül töreni iptal edildi.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ne yazık.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Umarım bir dahaki sefere
tören yapılır!

FR:
Je sens que je vais remonter un
mastodonte au bout de ma ligne !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
L'heure du triomphe est proche !
